## 2. Build System Changes

### Android.bp (Application Build File)
```javascript
android_app {
    name: "SmartHomeControl",
    srcs: ["src/**/*.java"],
    resource_dirs: ["res"],
    platform_apis: true,
    certificate: "platform",
    privileged: true,
    
    static_libs: [
        "androidx.appcompat_appcompat",
        "androidx.recyclerview_recyclerview",
        "org.eclipse.paho.android.service",
        "org.eclipse.paho.client.mqttv3",
    ],
    
    optimize: {
        enabled: false,
    },
}
```

### device.mk (Add to device makefile)
```makefile
# Smart Home Control App
PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
    SmartHomeControl

# MQTT Libraries
PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
    org.eclipse.paho.android.service \
    org.eclipse.paho.client.mqttv3
```

