## 5. SELinux Policies

### sepolicy/smarthome.te
```
# Smart Home App Domain
type smarthome_app, domain;
app_domain(smarthome_app)

# Network access
allow smarthome_app self:tcp_socket create_stream_socket_perms;
allow smarthome_app port:tcp_socket name_connect;
allow smarthome_app node:tcp_socket node_bind;

# Wake lock
allow smarthome_app sysfs_wake_lock:file { open write };

# Service manager
allow smarthome_app system_server:binder call;
```

### file_contexts
```
/system/app/SmartHomeControl(/.*)?    u:object_r:system_app_data_file:s0
/data/data/com.android.smarthome(/.*)?  u:object_r:app_data_file:s0
```

