## 7. Build Commands

### Building the App
```bash
# Navigate to AOSP root
cd $AOSP_ROOT

# Build the app
m SmartHomeControl

# Install to device
adb install -r out/target/product/[device]/system/app/SmartHomeControl/SmartHomeControl.apk

# Or flash entire system
m -j$(nproc)
adb reboot bootloader
fastboot flashall
```

### Building as System App
```bash
# Make it a privileged app
mm -j8 SmartHomeControl
adb root
adb remount
adb push out/target/product/[device]/system/priv-app/SmartHomeControl/SmartHomeControl.apk /system/priv-app/SmartHomeControl/
adb reboot
```

